      ground. Soil creepers follow the farms \u2014 Defend Area."
    VictoryLog: "Earth secured. Lunar Rocket is on the pad \u2014 trajectory to Luna
      is open."
    FailLog: Earth outpost lost. Revive the robots or restart the drop.
    EndlessLog: "Earth holds. Keep colonizing this crust \u2014 rating stands, no
      hop."
